## Iridium 1.0.21 - Telegram Bot & CLI Improvements

### Telegram Bot Updates
- Added max_ips field when creating users
- Added max_ips editing in user management
- Added toggle for unlimited IP status
- Improved user info display with all fields (max_ips, unlimited_ip, note, status)
- Better formatted messages with emojis

### CLI Visual Improvements (WIP)
- New Iridium ASCII art header
- Modern color scheme with brand colors
- New UI helper functions (print_success, print_error, etc.)
- Progress spinner for long operations
- Better prompts with default values
- Countdown timers instead of "Press Enter"
